98049660460", "personaname": "Phillip Mabutt", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/professorlicme8/", "num_games_owned": 583, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 2234, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2206, "last_played": 1787810390, "avatar": "ad258ff6c94c06a1c2137dda2a2df2e7ed6cbd18"}, "language": "english", "review": "A pretty good game, but whoever wrote the \"banter\" needs to be shot. Especially in the prologue, the levels of cringe will make you want to hurt yourself and others. It's Forspoken levels of just constant generic back and forth dialogue that even a 10 year old would call cringe. If you can force yourself through the beginning until you get your own ship then you will have a good time. There's an actually good game with an interesting story beneath the terrible terrible TERRIBLE dialogue.", "timestamp_created": 1787510625, "timestamp_updated": 1787511415, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233528925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028540693", "personaname": "Cardgage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zeekiller1337/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 8999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8999, "last_played": 1787505286, "avatar": "950f9f3147d4c8530a5072825d01c34ee3f1afa1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easily one of the best sci-fi games I have ever played. 150 hours to nearly 100% the game - and worth every minute. The combat is fun throughout the entire experience, and the story grows in depth as it unfolds - as do the relationships with your crewmates.\n\n10/10 Mass Effect Experience. Encountered zero bugs, just amazing gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1787505505, "timestamp_updated": 1787505505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233518884", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020877958", "personaname": "Kasorayn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020877958/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 5074, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5074, "last_played": 1787497710, "avatar": "251526d11138cba25529e0982e184d19f06329e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Andromeda got a lot of flak back in the day, but it still holds up.  Took about 70 hours for a 97% completion playthrough, worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1787497805, "timestamp_updated": 1787497805, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}